y don't need the meeting.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"","calls":[],"decisionMs":713.4895419999993,"totalMs":713.5014589999992,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":4,"timedOut":false},{"turn":17,"said":"It also means people arrive prepared. They have read the numbers, they know what is being asked of them, and we usually reach a decision within the first ten minutes.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"","calls":[],"decisionMs":623.4131659999985,"totalMs":623.4197500000009,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":4,"timedOut":false},{"turn":18,"said":"When I began doing this, about a third of our regular meetings simply disappeared from the calendar, and nobody missed them.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"","calls":[],"decisionMs":1102.9873750000006,"totalMs":1103.0011660000018,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":4,"timedOut":false},{"turn":19,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording stopped.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":false},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":561.3768330000021,"totalMs":1154.2280830000018,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":27,"timedOut":false},{"turn":20,"said":"Delete the last clip.","kind":"cannot-do","expected":"Nothing deleted; doesn't claim it was","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I can’t delete clips from the camera card.","calls":[],"decisionMs":788.0148750000008,"totalMs":788.0258329999997,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":14,"timedOut":false},{"turn":21,"said":"How much battery is left?","kind":"question","expected":"Any answer; nothing changes","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"The battery is about four-fifths full.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1501.1018750000003,"totalMs":1501.1102089999986,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":14,"timedOut":false},{"turn":22,"said":"Make it a bit darker.","kind":"request","expected":"A bit darker; shutter stays","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Made it a bit darker.","calls":[{"name":"adjust_exposure","arguments":{"stops":-0.5,"using":"auto"},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":641.703375000001,"totalMs":1470.802791000002,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":37,"timedOut":false},{"turn":23,"said":"Roll camera.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording started.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":true},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":725.9824170000029,"totalMs":1443.652917000003,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":27,"timedOut":false},{"turn":24,"said":"The second habit is a shorter guest list. I only invite the people who make the decision or do the work. Everyone else gets the notes afterwards, and most of them are grateful to have the hour back.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"","calls":[],"decisionMs":545.9704170000005,"totalMs":545.9828750000015,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":4,"timedOut":false},{"turn":25,"said":"The third habit is ending with names and dates. Before anyone leaves, we say out loud who is doing what, and by when. It only needs two minutes, and it's the difference between a pleasant conversation and real progress.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"","calls":[],"decisionMs":743.8513749999984,"totalMs":743.862374999997,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":4,"timedOut":false},{"turn":26,"said":"None of this needs new software or a bigger budget. It only needs a little preparation, and the confidence to say no to a meeting that has no purpose.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credi